@startuml teranode block assembly pipeline

title Block Assembly Pipeline
hide footbox

participant "Event Bus" as eventbus <<external>>
participant "Mempool" as mempool <<component>>
participant "BlockAssembler" as blockassembler <<component>>
participant "UtxoStorage\n(write only)" as utxostorage <<component>>

|||
loop message published by Mempool ( addToBlockTemplateMsg )
|||
    mempool o--> eventbus : publish addToBlockTemplateMsg
|||
end loop
|||
loop message consumed by BlockAssembler ( addToBlockTemplateMsg )
|||
    |||
    note over blockassembler, mempool
        Instructs BlockAssembler to add transaction to the mining block template identified with
        tmplTipId. Mempool also supplies seqNo, which is an monotonically increasing number.
        BlockAssembler can use the seqNo to identify transaction gaps that are caused by message
        reordering in the framework.
    end note
    |||
    eventbus o--> blockassembler : consume [[https://ncryptnchain.sharepoint.com/:u:/r/sites/Teranode/Shared%20Documents/Architecture/Sequence%20Diagrams/block_assembly/block_assembly_2_1.svg?csf=1&web=1&e=MqmEXC{Tooltip for message} addToBlockTemplateMsg]]
    activate blockassembler
        par
            blockassembler --> blockassembler : create getActiveTipMsg
            blockassembler --> eventbus : publish getActiveTipMsg
        |||
        else
        |||
            loop
            |||
                blockassembler --> blockassembler : create utxoSpendMsg
                blockassembler --> eventbus : publish utxoSpendMsg
            |||
            end loop
        end
    deactivate blockassembler
|||
end loop
|||
loop message consumed by UtxoStorage ( utxoSpendMsg )
|||
    note over mempool
        UTXO verifies that coin is accepted and not
        yet spent in the given tmplTipId chain by
        some other transaction.
    end note
    eventbus o--> utxostorage :  consume [[https://ncryptnchain.sharepoint.com/:u:/r/sites/Teranode/Shared%20Documents/Architecture/Sequence%20Diagrams/block_assembly/block_assembly_2_2.svg?csf=1&web=1&e=8sACDd{Tooltip for message} utxoSpendMsg]]
    activate utxostorage
        utxostorage --> utxostorage : create\nReturnUtxoSpendMsg
        utxostorage --> eventbus : publish ReturnUtxoSpendMsg
    deactivate utxostorage
|||
end loop
|||
loop message consumed by UtxoStorage ( returnUtxoSpendMsg)
|||
    eventbus o--> utxostorage : consume [[https://ncryptnchain.sharepoint.com/:u:/r/sites/Teranode/Shared%20Documents/Architecture/Sequence%20Diagrams/block_assembly/block_assembly_2_3.svg?csf=1&web=1&e=IercLU{Tooltip for message} returnUtxoSpendMsg]]
    note over mempool
        Record to accept transaction’s outputs
        is written into AOL.
    end note
    activate utxostorage
        utxostorage --> utxostorage : create responseMsg
        utxostorage --> eventbus : publish responseMsg
    deactivate utxostorage
|||
end loop
@enduml
